MARKER: K = lua:function_at_spot("dcc_kiosk_activate", {}, true, { feature_description = "a loot box kiosk", dcc_kiosk = "1" })
MAP
xxxx+xxxx
x.......x
x{.K.S.(x
x...[...x
xxxxxxxxx
ENDMAP

